    <ul>
      <li><strong>Toronto vs New York:</strong> Always 0 hours difference. Ideal for financial synchronization.</li>
      <li><strong>Toronto vs London:</strong> London is 5 hours ahead. Schedule meetings between 9:00 a.m. and 12:00 p.m. Toronto Time (2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. UK Time).</li>
      <li><strong>Toronto vs Los Angeles:</strong> Los Angeles is 3 hours behind. Schedule meetings in the afternoon in Toronto (1:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. ET) to align with West Coast mornings.</li>
