      <li><strong>Ignoring Ontario Time Splits:</strong> Western Ontario locations are in Central Time, not Eastern Time. Check coordinates before setting meeting times.</li>
      <li><strong>Ignoring DST transition gaps:</strong> The UK and Europe transition to DST on different dates compared to Canada, altering standard time gaps for a few weeks in spring and autumn.</li>
    </ol>
